{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u30bf\u30f3\u30b0\u30b9\u30c6\u30f3\u306e\u5fa9\u8b90\u5287 -The Revenge Of Tungsten-",
    "steam_appid": 2433240,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/31eaa56209e35e46ddf1585950fd0da0.avif?t=1733532079\" /></span>.<br>Tungsten's Revenge Play is an unusual bullet-hell STG.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/97808194dcef1b3e32dd944d32b25df0.avif?t=1733532079\" /></span>.<br>Once upon a time, there was a witch who had a world in her mind.<br>In that world, emotions and desires lived in human form.<br><br>--One day, the witch fell asleep and never woke up.<br>Some personalities noticed this and set out for the sleeping world to clear their doubts. ......<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/39fb43d9db876689a9c45b61631b3e38.avif?t=1733532079\" /></span>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/b6297004523a6f868b887c20d0f30ed7.avif?t=1733532079\" /></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Witches' Thoughts <strong>Kurokuneri Kaka</strong></h2>A personality that thinks and does not act.<br><br>Concerned about witches who no longer awaken from sleep, she is heavy-hearted.<br>Because of her thin-skinned personality, she easily loses it when people are kind to her.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/79b314c607fd14be2a17abd9196f15f8.avif?t=1733532079\" /></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Witch Happiness <strong>Miyo Farland</strong></h2>An auspicious personality from the planet of smiles.<br><br>Scheming to bring good fortune to the more unfortunate, he begins to search for witches.<br>His own happiness boiling point is very low, so he is vulnerable to all temptations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/666d7a3035b3ee006cbda9992658794f.avif?t=1733532079\" /></span>.<br><u>While your ship is shooting, enemy bullets are invisible</u>, which is the most important feature of this game.<br>If you touch an enemy bullet even though you cannot see it, you will miss. Memorize the barrage, predict it, and sometimes hope for the best.<br><br>Also, you can gain benefits such as increased attack power, HP recovery, etc. by keeping shooting shots for a certain time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/47378724630401b2d8eab094f905ce9e.poster.avif?t=1733532079\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/47378724630401b2d8eab094f905ce9e.webm?t=1733532079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/47378724630401b2d8eab094f905ce9e.mp4?t=1733532079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/9abb7d9b68824b7c753eaefee29bfb8c.avif?t=1733532079\" /></span>.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 2D and 3D backgrounds<br></li><li> 4 difficulty levels to choose from, tutorial included<br></li><li> 5 stages &amp; bosses<br></li><li> 5 happy game overs<br></li><li> Gamepad and Ace-Controller support.<br></li><li> Developed by one person, overwhelmingly handmade!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/31874279dd422f3407ab22f42ec49b8f.avif?t=1733532079\" /></span>.<br>This game contains extreme bullet scenes and some vulgarity!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/31eaa56209e35e46ddf1585950fd0da0.avif?t=1733532079\" /></span>.<br>Tungsten's Revenge Play is an unusual bullet-hell STG.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/97808194dcef1b3e32dd944d32b25df0.avif?t=1733532079\" /></span>.<br>Once upon a time, there was a witch who had a world in her mind.<br>In that world, emotions and desires lived in human form.<br><br>--One day, the witch fell asleep and never woke up.<br>Some personalities noticed this and set out for the sleeping world to clear their doubts. ......<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/39fb43d9db876689a9c45b61631b3e38.avif?t=1733532079\" /></span>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/b6297004523a6f868b887c20d0f30ed7.avif?t=1733532079\" /></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Witches' Thoughts <strong>Kurokuneri Kaka</strong></h2>A personality that thinks and does not act.<br><br>Concerned about witches who no longer awaken from sleep, she is heavy-hearted.<br>Because of her thin-skinned personality, she easily loses it when people are kind to her.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433240/extras/79b314c607fd14be2a17abd9196f15f8.avif?t=1733532079\" /></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Witch Happiness <strong>Miyo Farland</strong></h2>An auspicious personality from the planet of smiles.<br><br>Scheming to bring good fortune to the more unfortunate, he begins to search for witches.<br>His own happiness boiling point is very low, so he is vulnerable to all temptations.<